#    Each iteration of the outer `i` loop writes to a distinct row of `data`,
#    and `mean` is read-only here, so iterations are independent and safe
#    to parallelize.
kernel_covariance = parallelize_loop(
    kernel_covariance,
    kernel_covariance.find_loop("i #1"),
)

